  "_comment": "The worker boundary. requests: a POST /decide body as the orchestrator's adapter builds it, and the worker's verdict: accepted, or refused with its error_type and the path of the first fault (zod's dotted style), which the orchestrator's CheckQuestions must name first. Prose is not the contract and is not compared. replies: a worker body as raw JSON for those questions, and the adapter's verdict: the answers it reads, or an excerpt of its own parse error. Read by services/dita-orchestrator/decisions (Go) and services/inferences-system-one/tests (Python).",
